{
  "Combat.LivingStatue.Backhand.ItChitsYou": " It chits you square in the chest. The momentum sends you flying through the air. You land with a crunch against a wall. <b>You'll have to run back to the giant to engage it in melee once more.</b>"
  "Combat.LivingStatue.Backhand.TheMarbleGolem": "The marble golem's visage twists into a grimace of irritation, and it swings its hand at you in a vicious backhand."
  "Combat.LivingStatue.Backhand.YouSlideUnderneath": " You slide underneath the surprise swing!"
  "Combat.LivingStatue.ConcussiveBlow.TheGiantRaises": "The giant raises his hammer for an obvious downward strike. His marble muscles flex as he swings it downward. You're able to hop out of the way of the clearly telegraphed attack, but nothing could prepare you for the shockwave it emits as it craters the ground. "
  "Combat.LivingStatue.ConcussiveBlow.TheVibrationsLeave": "<b>The vibrations leave you rattled and stunned. It'll take you a moment to recover!</b>"
  "Combat.LivingStatue.ConcussiveBlow.YouShakeOff": "You shake off the vibrations immediately. It'll take more than that to stop you!"
  "Combat.LivingStatue.CycloneStrike.ByTheGrace": " By the grace of the gods, you somehow avoid the spinning hammer."
  "Combat.LivingStatue.CycloneStrike.TwistingBackThe": "Twisting back, the giant abruptly launches into a circular spin. Its hammer stays low enough to the ground that its circular path is tearing a swath of destruction through the once pristine garden, and it's coming in your direction!"
  "Combat.LivingStatue.CycloneStrike.YouReSquarely": " You're squarely struck by the spinning hammer."
  "Combat.LivingStatue.DescribeAttacked.Bounce": "Your {0} bounces harmlessly off {1}."
  "Combat.LivingStatue.DescribeAttacked.Glancing": "You strike a glancing blow on {0}!"
  "Combat.LivingStatue.DescribeAttacked.High": "{0} cracks under your powerful {1}!"
  "Combat.LivingStatue.DescribeAttacked.Medium": "You {0} {1}, sending shards of {2} flying!"
  "Combat.LivingStatue.DescribeAttacked.Shatter": "You [b:shatter] {0} with your powerful {1}!"
  "Combat.LivingStatue.DirtKick.TheAnimatedSculpture": "The animated sculpture brings its right foot around, dragging it through the gardens at a high enough speed to tear a half score of bushes out by the root. A cloud of shrubbery and dirt washes over you!"
  "Combat.LivingStatue.DirtKick.YouAreBlinded": " <b>You are blinded!</b>"
  "Combat.LivingStatue.DirtKick.YouCloseYour": " You close your eyes until it passes and resume the fight!"
  "Combat.LivingStatue.Disarm.TheAnimatedStatue": "The animated statue spins its hammer around, striking at your [weapon] with its haft."
  "Combat.LivingStatue.Disarm.YouManageTo": " You manage to hold onto your equipment, for now."
  "Combat.LivingStatue.Disarm.YourEquipmentFlies": " Your equipment flies off into the bushes! You'll have to fight another way. "
  "Combat.LivingStatue.HandleFear.TheStoneGiant": "The stone giant cares little for your attempted intimidation."
  "Combat.LivingStatue.HandleStun.TheStoneGiant": "The stone giant's unforgiving flesh seems incapable of being stunned."
  "Combat.LivingStatue.OverhandSmash.RaisingItsHammer": "Raising its hammer high overhead, the giant swiftly brings its hammer down in a punishing strike!"
  "Combat.LivingStatue.OverhandSmash.TheConcussiveStrike": " The concussive strike impacts you with bonecrushing force."
  "Combat.LivingStatue.OverhandSmash.YouReAble": " You're able to sidestep it just in time."
  "Combat.LivingStatue.React.TheGolemDoesn": "[pg]The golem doesn't seem to be affected! Its magically animated eyes aren't affected by spells![pg]"
}
